GRID=(r'网格为$\mathbb Z_M\times\mathbb Z_N$，$M,N>0$；有限核偏移$I$可重复映到网格，仍逐偏移求和。',r'The grid is $\mathbb Z_M\times\mathbb Z_N$, with $M,N>0$. A finite offset set $I$ may map repeatedly to the grid; every offset still contributes.')
