SOM=(r'$SOM(Z)=\mathbb E|Z|^2$，复方差$V(Z)=\mathbb E|Z-\mathbb EZ|^2$，伪协方差$C(Z)=\mathbb E(Z-\mathbb EZ)^2$；实Gaussian嵌入复数后$C(Z)$等于实方差。',r'$SOM(Z)=\mathbb E|Z|^2$, complex variance $V(Z)=\mathbb E|Z-\mathbb EZ|^2$, and pseudocovariance $C(Z)=\mathbb E(Z-\mathbb EZ)^2$. A real Gaussian embedded in the complex plane has pseudocovariance equal to its real variance.')
