 r=rows['decoder-backpropagation']
 r['proof_steps'][1]['body_md']=r'设$D_d(m,n)$为真实空间Riesz梯度，先定义$E_d(k)=\widehat D_d(k)/(MN)$。Parseval给$r_{dcts}=\sum_k\overline{\chi_k(t,s)\widehat F_c(k)}E_d(k)$。核偏移正相位求和后，令$q_{dc}(u,v)=\sum_k\chi_{k,uv}\overline{\widehat F_c(k)}E_d(k)$，因此正相位核梯度响应为$MNq$；有限$\chi$包含所有对角项。'
