 r['proof_steps'][2]['body_md']=r'$T$对实$W$线性，精确更新为$\Delta T=-\eta\sum_{t,s}r_{dcts}\chi_{uv}(t,s)=-\eta MNq$。作者A.3把复共轭梯度按完整实梯度解释；若另用标准Wirtinger导数，实Riesz梯度为其两倍，不能混用。前缀取实际Cor3.3频谱，后缀泛函经共轭谱矩阵传递；整条前后缀链的机器组合仍待完成。'
 r['translations']['en']['proof_steps'][2]['body_md']=r'$T$ is linear in real $W$, so the exact update is $\Delta T=-\eta\sum_{t,s}r_{dcts}\chi_{uv}(t,s)=-\eta MNq$. Appendix A.3 interprets its conjugate gradient as the full real gradient. If standard Wirtinger derivatives are used separately, the real Riesz gradient is twice that derivative; the conventions must not be mixed. The prefix is the actual Corollary 3.3 spectrum and the suffix functional is transported through conjugated spectral matrices. Machine composition of the complete prefix/suffix chain is still pending.'
 r=rows['decoder-single-channel-moments']
 r['proof_steps'][0]['body_md']=r'每个$T_l$是该层有限实核数组的可测相位和。整个层向量独立经可测函数保持，得到$T_l$和$|T_l|^2$各自独立。复Bochner乘积积分给$\mathbb E\prod_lT_l=\prod_l\mathbb ET_l=\prod_l(\mu_lR_{uv})$，其值和所有Gaussian核均值由真实律推导，不预先假设待证乘积式。'
 r['proof_steps'][0]['formula_tex']=r'\mathbb E\mathbb T^{(uv)(L:1)}=\prod_{l=1}^L(\mu_lR_{uv}),\qquad\left|\prod_lT_l\right|^2=\prod_l|T_l|^2'
 r['proof_steps'][0]['lean_refs']=names('actual_independent_layer_mean','independent_complex_product_mean','actual_independent_layer_moments')
 r['translations']['en']['proof_steps'][0]['body_md']=r'Each $T_l$ is a measurable phase sum of that layer’s finite real kernel array. Measurable maps preserve independence of whole layer vectors, so both the responses and their squared magnitudes are independent families. The complex Bochner product integral gives $\mathbb E\prod_lT_l=\prod_l\mathbb ET_l=\prod_l(\mu_lR_{uv})$. All Gaussian kernel means are derived from actual laws; the desired product identity is not assumed.'
 r['translations']['en']['proof_steps'][0]['lean_refs']=r['proof_steps'][0]['lean_refs']
 r['scope']='真正独立层模型的实际单通道复均值、乘积SOM及正矩log完整验证；源Eq6–7弱条件与无条件指数增长独立评估。'
