 r['proof_steps'][0]['formula_tex']=r'\widehat h_d(k^{\prime})=M^{\prime}N^{\prime}\delta_{k^{\prime},0}b_d+\sum_{c,k}\alpha_{k^{\prime}k}T_{dc}(k)\widehat f_c(k),\qquad\alpha_{k^{\prime}k}=\frac1{MN}\sum_{m<M^{\prime},n<N^{\prime}}\chi_k(m,n)\overline{\chi_{k^{\prime}}^{\prime}(m,n)}'
 r['translations']['en']['proof_steps'][0]['body_md']=r'First let the output sizes be arbitrary positive $M^{\prime},N^{\prime}$. Substitute the input inverse DFT into the actual positive-offset convolution and exchange finite sums to obtain $\widehat h_d(k^{\prime})=M^{\prime}N^{\prime}\delta_{k^{\prime},0}b_d+\sum_{c,k}\alpha_{k^{\prime}k}T_{dc}(k)\widehat f_c(k)$, with $\alpha_{k^{\prime}k}=(MN)^{-1}\sum_{m<M^{\prime},n<N^{\prime}}\chi_k(m,n)\overline{\chi_{k^{\prime}}^{\prime}(m,n)}$. For valid convolution, put $M^{\prime}=M-K+1,N^{\prime}=N-K+1$. These are the actual term counts. The source sine numerators omit one term; its phase correctly uses the term count minus one.'
 r['proof_steps'][0]['body_md']=r['proof_steps'][0]['body_md'].replace('输出尺寸先取任意',r'一般输出取样先按旧循环网格周期延拓输入，使所有正偏移可定义，再取任意').replace('无padding时取',r'原无padding操作另要求$1\le K\le\min(M,N)$，这保证所有取样与核偏移不越界；此时取')
