 issue('cascade-typos','A.2额外MN与层索引','Extra MN and layer indices in A.2','proof_step_error',[14],r'\delta MN(\cdots+MNb^{(L)})',r'正文β=MN乘全括号正确；A2末展开一行内多MN并把若干T层上标写l，逐层仿射归纳给正确同一命题。',r'The main β formula correctly multiplies the whole bracket by MN; an A.2 line adds an inner MN and reuses layer l on some T factors. Affine induction proves the same intended theorem correctly.','修局部证明，不改正文Cor3.3。','Repair the local proof without changing main Corollary3.3.',['cascade-forward'])
 issue('backprop-bars','A.3 Eq24局部共轭遗漏','A local conjugation omission in A.3 Equation (24)','proof_step_error',[17],r'\partial(g^{(L)})^\top',r'Eq24第一行g微分未带bar，第二行带bar；正文Eq5图上共轭完整，作者CR梯度约定从实梯度解释，不能把标准Wirtinger因子单独当原终式反例。',r'Equation (24) first omits a bar on the g differential while the next line includes it. The main Equation (5) has its conjugations. Interpret the source CR convention from the real gradient; a standard Wirtinger factor alone is not a counterexample to its final convention.','局部证明共轭修复；完整真实loss矩阵链现已实际验证。','A local conjugation repair; the complete actual-loss matrix chain is now verified.',['backpropagation'])
 issue('backprop-channel-shape','A.3漏输出通道求和及转置维度标注','A.3 omits an output-channel sum and reverses a transpose shape','proof_step_error',[17],r'\frac{\partial Loss}{\partial\overline F^{(l-1,c)}}=\sum_{t,s}W_{cts}^{[\mathrm{ker}=d]}\frac{\partial Loss}{\partial\overline F^{(l,d)}}',r'PDF17前层标量梯度左侧没有d，右侧却固定d且没有Σ_d，必须对全部输出通道求和。Eq22前文字把对(T的共轭转置)的导数标成D×C，实际g共轭列(C)与loss行(D)外积为C×D；T本身为D×C。重写从真实空间伴随和显式通道求和推导，不改变正确Eq23/正文Eq5矩阵终式。',r'On PDF17 the earlier-layer scalar gradient has no d on the left but a fixed d on the right without a sum over output channels; all d must be summed. The text before Equation (22) calls the derivative with respect to the conjugate transpose of T a D×C matrix, while its C-column/D-row outer product is C×D; T itself is D×C. The rewrite derives the adjoint from the real spatial operator with explicit channel sums, retaining the correct Equation (23) and main Equation (5).','仅局部证明漏和/维度注修复，原完整矩阵更新命题不被此问题否定。','Only local sum/shape annotations need repair; these errors do not refute the complete matrix-update statement.',['backpropagation'])
 issue('real-gaussian-cast','实Gaussian误写零复伪协方差','A real Gaussian incorrectly assigned zero pseudocovariance','proof_step_error',[19,20],r'W\sim Complex\mathcal N(\mu,\sigma^2,0)',r'实Gaussian复嵌入实际C(W)=σ²，非零方差时不是0；实际独立实线性组合得到原Eq27的C(T)=σ²R2u2v。',r'A real Gaussian embedded in the complex plane has C(W)=σ², not zero at positive variance. Actual independent real linear combinations give the correct C(T)=σ²R2u2v in Equation (27).','原Eq27最终矩结论正确，错误在中间圆对称替换。','The final Equation (27) moments are correct; the error is the intermediate circular replacement.',['gaussian-response'])
